# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# User financial data. None of this belongs in version control.
#
# The audit exports and the encrypted vault contain a complete picture of
# someone's holdings, cost basis and private annotations. The vault is
# encrypted, but an encrypted blob in a public repo is still an invitation.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bittax_*.csv
*_8949.csv
*_working_paper.csv
vault.enc
*.vault
wallets/
*.xpub
*.ypub
*.zpub
transactions.csv
history.csv
